<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\遊園地ホテル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―The time had reached 10:30 p.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After the haunted house, we rode things that were as tame as possible, like the merry-go-round and the teacups.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were run-of-the-mill attractions, so it was nice that the waits weren't that long, but today's lineup was way too unbalanced...<PG>
The two of us sisters were in the same room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even after we got into the hotel, we didn't really talk.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm going to bed. Don't make any noise."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
That was the only conversation we had in the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, she burrowed into bed before I could even answer, so it wasn't even a conversation.<PG>
How many years' worth of talking did we do in the haunted house today?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It really had been a long time since I'd had an actual conversation with <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe we'll never talk like that again...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
My phone rang.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I told you not to make any noise, didn't I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry, just for a bit..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was an incoming call from <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I pulled the covers over my head so my voice wouldn't carry.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Helloooo, Goto heeere."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"H-hello! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though I'd answered in a whisper, I heard <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE> loud voice.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry to call so late. I need you to stay calm and hear me out..."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what's wrong!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're the one who needs to calm down!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sat bolt upright and answered, forgetting to whisper.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry, it sounds like something serious."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Geez..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> turned away and pulled the covers over her head.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry for being loud..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, it's fine. What happened?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
When I said that, <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> took a big, deep breath.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">passed away."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\夜の高速.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―I was sitting in the passenger seat of the car, heading home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was no time to be having fun at the amusement park anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As soon as tomorrow, I would meet up with my senpai and head to Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To attend the funeral being held in the Arata settlement.<PG>
Dad and Mom had been drinking, so they couldn't drive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And at that hour, there were no trains either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So the one who drove was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\美冬ワゴン運転.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I didn't know you had a license... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Thanks."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Not like I had to tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dad and Mom stayed behind at the hotel, and the two of us set out on our own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> kept driving in silence.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was the air going to stay like this for the whole 2 hours until we got home?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\夜の高速.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The expressway's streetlights lit up the inside of the car on and off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Golden Week or not, at that hour it was nothing but trucks on the road.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> drove neither fast nor slow, keeping pace with the flow of traffic, matter-of-fact.<PG>
According to <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="5">Erika-chan</STYLE> had passed away a little while ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I suspected it was connected to that incident, but according to <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, the cause of death was apparently a heart attack, with no sign of foul play.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I found myself thinking back on what happened at Arata.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The only friend I ever allowed to call me 'Erina.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A friend more than 50 years older than me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A cute friend with a bit of a love for mischief.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A friend who risked her life to save us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The person who called me her last friend.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\夜の高速.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Uuu..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tears spilled over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At her age, maybe a sudden death like this couldn't be helped.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We'd been planning to all go see her this summer vacation...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\美冬ワゴン運転.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"How'd </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> die? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　An accident?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A heart attack, they think..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A heart attack!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Just how old is this friend of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">yours</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, anyway...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Around 70... I guess."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'re seriously a mystery when it comes to stuff like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis's</STYLE> exasperated voice, and a sigh.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why'd you become friends with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that person</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Just 'cause it seemed like we'd get along..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a while, <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> stayed quiet, her face still sullen.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\夜の高速.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sorry to be selfish, but can I talk about myself?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Talk about yourself...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Just a little... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">just a little, to anyone, doesn't matter who... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">there's something I need to get off my chest..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> wanted to tell me about herself...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She said anyone would do, but she'd gone out of her way to pick me...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay... I'll listen."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thanks... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sorry. I know </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'ve got a lot going on inside right now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, thanking me and apologizing to me...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the past few years, we'd barely even said hello.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">got my first boyfriend 5 years ago, in my first year of high school... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and less than a month after we started going out, he died in an accident."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"He was sweet, but a seriously rigid, straitlaced guy... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'re smarter, but he was smart too, and his grades were good. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And yet, even though we were going out, he couldn't ask me on a date himself, couldn't even hold my hand."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was all so delicate that I couldn't even <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="あいづち">nod along</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"After the accident, I went to his funeral, and his relatives took one look at my hair color and made a face. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That whole family was a highly educated bunch, all of them even more rigid than he was, and it was so uncomfortable I couldn't even pay my respects properly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Geez... back then that color was my natural hair color."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So that happened... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I didn't know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whatever... I never meant to talk about it anyway."</STYLE><PG>
These days <STYLE ID="1">Sis's</STYLE> hair was obviously dyed, but it had been a little light from birth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So she'd gone through all that because of it...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So, like, after that, studying hard and going to school just started to seem stupid... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't want to become the kind of person who looks at someone like that just because their hair's a little different. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I got sick of living smart and proper. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I dropped out of high school. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I just... I don't really know, I got sick of it."</STYLE><PG>
Why was she telling me this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> had always been smart, and her grades were always near the top.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was true my test scores and deviation scores were higher, though.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, Dad and Mom always praised <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My parents aren't the kind of people who compare sisters.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I figured even </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, the so-called genius girl, would end up a rigid, prejudiced person too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Surely Dad and Mom too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So... that's how it was..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I wanted to get out of a house like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm a dropout, so there aren't many good jobs, but I figured I'd work part-time, save up money, and stand on my own feet soon... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I worked my part-time jobs every day."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So you were never home because you were working... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I was sure you were out playing around with guys."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\美冬ワゴン運転.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Guys?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, you're always on the phone with some different guy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh heh heh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahahahahaha! Guys...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Me, playing around with guys!? Ahahahahaha"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hahahahaha... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, my stomach hurts... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Guys? As if! I don't have time to play around with guys! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Forget guys, do you have any idea how much I held off even hanging out with friends so I could work!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time in years I'd seen <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> smile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But somewhere in it, there was an air of sorrow.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sometimes, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'd hear you on the phone with men, so I just assumed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And it seemed like it was someone different every time."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I do customer-service work too, so there were quite a few people coming at me with 'give me your number' and 'let's go out sometime.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">They're customers, so I have to be careful not to be rude, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> probably heard me talking to them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Aren't you supposed to say no when people ask for your number?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> probably don't know this, but it gets pretty complicated. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Some were friends of regulars, and some even had my number and I don't know where they got it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I finally finished turning them all down the other day. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And I've saved up a good amount of money, so I came today thinking of it as our last family trip, but..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Last trip... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So you're leaving home soon?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's the plan. That's why I've worked these 5 years without having any fun."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Now I can finally get away from the family. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Like I said before, I don't get along with smart people."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">but, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'ve changed, huh. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In elementary school you were gloomy the whole time, and I figured you'd turn into a rigid person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To be honest, part of me was relieved. That I'd guessed right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">once you got to middle school, you suddenly got cheerful, and you had more friends... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And on top of that, you were still the genius girl, same as ever. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">a 70-year-old friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Makes me laugh..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I thought smart people were more biased... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">but like today, even your senpai rely on you, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">you're always cheerful, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">everyone likes you, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">you cheer up everyone around you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> got that far and then, still gripping the wheel, started crying, tears streaming down.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">what have I been doing all this time... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the one who's prejudiced and rigid... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">is me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> turned off toward the rest area we had been about to pass.<PG>
