{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Uu... uu..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> was slumped over the wheel, crying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"This might sound bad, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I thought the way you turned out was because of an inferiority complex about me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So I thought you hated me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If I hated you, I wouldn't be driving you home in the middle of the night!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry I never noticed till now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whatever... I didn't want you to notice anyway..."</STYLE><PG>
So that was why <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> had been avoiding me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Worried that I'd become a rigid person, and that <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> and I would have a real falling out.<PG>
It was just like <STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE> said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We'd only been a little out of step, yet I'd been afraid to make the first move, and avoided her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I've never once looked down on <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> or made fun of her.<PG>
I'd just thought she seemed like a delinquent, and that she lived in a different world from me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I should have noticed.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm... not being fair, am I? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Blaming other people for how I turned out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Blaming my dead boyfriend's family, trying to convince myself it's not my fault. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... no, that's not it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">His family had nothing to do with it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I was scared </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'d abandon me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Abandon...? What are you talking about..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Back when we were little, I thought </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> were so cute. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Except for school, I was glued to you the whole time, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I remember."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got smarter than me, little by little. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I was supposed to be the one teaching, and that started to flip around. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">We're a whole 5 years apart, and it got to where you were even teaching me my schoolwork... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I stopped knowing what my reason to exist as your big sister even was... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That maybe </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> didn't need me anymore..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Nothing like that...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I've never once thought anything like that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I know that...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I know, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I was scared. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Of being abandoned... of not being needed, I was scared..."</STYLE><PG>
So my idea that an inferiority complex toward me was the cause had apparently been half right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd thought it was a question of who was smarter, but that was where I was wrong.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> had been afraid that I would reject her very existence.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At her dead boyfriend's funeral, it all blew up. A rift opened between us.<PG>
And I'd convinced myself that <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, feeling all that, was a badly behaved person who lived in a different world.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is the 'prejudice' I held against <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A blunder of mine, one I have to admit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, the rest is up to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to let her know that I'm not her enemy, that I'll always be <STYLE ID="1">Sis's</STYLE> little sister.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'd never, ever abandon you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The bond between sisters isn't something that can be cut, no matter what. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">No, even if it comes close to being cut, I'll protect it to the very end."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's not too late, even now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Dad and Mom are always worried about you too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's a lie...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　They're both always going '</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina, Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'... doting on nobody but </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's because, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, after you quit school, they didn't know how to act around you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So once they knew you were coming today, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, they were both really looking forward to this day."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uu, uuu...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd meant to comfort her, but <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> only started crying harder.<PG>
