<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="2">Um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You don't have to hide it. I can tell that much."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wasn't so much that I hated her; I found her hard to deal with.<PG>
No, I'd thought <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> had an inferiority complex about me, and hated me because of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was why I'd found her hard to approach.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The haunted house was a little bit fun. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It reminded me of when we were kids. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The two of us used to go to Zahha all the time and eat Russian takoyaki... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I was always the one who lost, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> seemed to have calmed down a little.<PG>
Like <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> said, we were really close when we were kids.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe things started changing little by little around when <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> started high school.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Do you know why you were born, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The reason I was born...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">when I was little, I pestered Mom. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I told her I wanted a little sister."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you did?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It was back when I was little, right around when I was turning 2. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I remember it clearly. I saw a baby that belonged to one of Mom's friends. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It was super cute."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
