―It was on the way home that day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At a cafe we stopped in at―<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, Mama! I wan' a baby sister!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Momoko</STYLE>, we'll talk about that later, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No! Wan' a baby sister! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I picked a name! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that's her name! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Isn't it cute!?"</STYLE><PG>
"All right, all right... Later, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Really!? I'm getting a baby sister!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Yaaay! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s comiiing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Momoko</STYLE>...! Don't say it so loud...!"<PG>
