{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So this name... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're the one who gave it to me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, yeah. I guess technically that makes me the one who named you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hate my own name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Erina: a name way too cute for me.<PG>
Knowing that <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> thought it up when she was little, maybe I can come to like it a bit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A name <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> thought up for me when she was small.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A name she gave me because she wanted me to come.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">me coming along... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">did it make you happy...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You expect me to say something like that, the way I am right now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, never mind!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I flashed <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> a big grin.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Been a while since I saw that face. You always looked away whenever you saw me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well... of course I looked away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, figures..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, I won't look away anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">so stay with me. Don't run away from home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm already 20, so it's not like it matters if I leave..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I want to get back all that time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The 5 years we spent apart, I want them back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You're just after my savings, aren't you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No way...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm kidding. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Aw, man, if I quit running away from home, I'll just be a rich girl."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You've got that much saved?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, if you're curious, then you really are after my savings."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I said I'm kidding..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Come on... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you don't have any reason to run away from home now, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, stay with me a while longer, please."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ugh, fine, fine, I get it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought I'd get to live as a NEET for a while, and instead I end up spending my money on my </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">little sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Was that a joke too...?"</STYLE>
