{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I mean... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">―if I can spend it on you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? What'd you say?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ugh, forget it! It's nothing! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　More importantly, I'm stopping at the next rest area again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You can't go to a funeral empty-handed, and you won't have time to buy anything tomorrow, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Anything's fine, just get a gift to bring..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... thanks, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whatever..."</STYLE><PG>
Tomorrow I had to work out a time with my <STYLE ID="3">senpai</STYLE> and go to Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was hardly any time to prepare, and I still didn't really know the schedule.<PG>
